{"title": "Fear of Wolves", "pageid": 9076, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fear_of_Wolves", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fear_of_Wolves.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Fear_of_Wolves.webp/300px-Fear_of_Wolves.webp, /w/images/e/ec/Fear_of_Wolves.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Fear_of_Wolves.webp/300px-Fear_of_Wolves.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Fear_of_Wolves.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Fear of Wolves</b> is one of <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a>'s passive features. When approaching a lupine creature, she may become Frightened.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Shadowheart's scalp prickles with fear when she encounters wolves. If she steps within 9 m (30 ft) of a lupine creature, she must make a DC 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or become <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart\" title=\"Shadowheart\">Shadowheart</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Does not trigger when approaching a friendly <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druid</a> using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Wolf\" title=\"Wild Shape: Wolf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape: Wolf\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Wild_Shape_Wolf_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape:_Wolf\" title=\"Wild Shape: Wolf\">Wild Shape: Wolf</a>, or a friendly <a href=\"/wiki/Beast_Master\" title=\"Beast Master\">Beast Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger\" title=\"Ranger\">Ranger</a>'s <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Companion\" title=\"Wolf Companion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp/25px-Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp/38px-Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp/50px-Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wolf Companion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp/25px-Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Wolf_Companion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wolf_Companion\" title=\"Wolf Companion\">Wolf Companion</a>.</li>\n<li>This feature is removed after Shadowheart spares <a href=\"/wiki/Dame_Aylin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dame Aylin\">Dame Aylin</a> and is shown the truth about her family.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">When within 9 m (30 ft) of a wolf, must roll a <a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a> 15 <a href=\"/wiki/WIS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"WIS\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">save</a> or become <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a>.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202246\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1309/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 9110/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5316/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 136/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 704273/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.276      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   40.276      1 -total\n 32.76%   13.194      4 Template:Icon_text\n 27.49%   11.071      8 Template:Trim\n 22.79%    9.178      1 Template:SavingThrow\n 19.87%    8.003      4 Template:Ifempty\n 16.59%    6.683      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.64%    5.895      1 Template:Cond\n 12.55%    5.053      3 Template:Icon_link\n 10.86%    4.373      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:9076-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202246 and revision id 370588. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}